# CODEOWNERS file
# This file defines who must review changes to specific files/directories
# GitHub will automatically request reviews from these owners

# Default: Repository owners must review all changes
* @OWNER_USERNAME

# Exception: Anyone can submit to data/submissions/ without owner review
# (But automated validation will still check the submission)
data/submissions/* 

# Critical files require owner approval
/.github/workflows/* @OWNER_USERNAME
/scripts/* @OWNER_USERNAME
/src/* @OWNER_USERNAME
/requirements*.txt @OWNER_USERNAME
/SECURITY.md @OWNER_USERNAME
README.md @OWNER_USERNAME
